.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-DB 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-db \- Respace, attach or migrate the store file
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu db\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Respace, attach or migrate the store file
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-db\-respace(1)
Copy the store into a term space
.TP
quipu\-db\-attach(1)
List the databases mounted alongside this store
.TP
quipu\-db\-migrate\-inferred(1)
Move engine\-derived facts into their companion inferred graphs
.TP
quipu\-db\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
